{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/1458865-if-you-had-to-make-a-z-axis-for-demons-what-would-it-be","id":1458865,"title":"If you had to make a z-axis for Demons, what would it be?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-09-05T13:09:52-07:00","id":1458865,"title":"If you had to make a z-axis for Demons, what would it be?","content":"Back in the early game lines of 1st edition, it seemed that every splat had its own (optional) z-axis: Bloodlines for Vampire, Lodges for Werewolf, Legacies for Mage, Entitlements for Changeling and Athanors for Promethean. Later game lines, however, didn't have any and 2nd edition didn't change the trend.<br /> <br /> So I was wondering what ideas could come up as a z-axis for Demons. Perhaps specific subsets of Agendas with a particular regional or thematic focus (a bit like Lodges)?<br /> <br /> Note that this is just a thought experiment for fun. Not discussing whether Demons <i>should or shouldn't</i> have a z-axis.<br /> <br /> Any ideas?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26440-moonwhisper","name":"moonwhisper","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26440_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"99"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-05T13:23:36-07:00","id":1458867,"title":"","content":"Perhaps a variation of a Cover that is integrated to the point where it becomes part of the demon's personal identity? As in, it cannot be burnt or otherwise reduced to 0 (although still capable of racking up bad Compromise Conditions) and brings some advantages that becomes available regardless of which Cover the demon is in (though using them could definitely be sources of Compromise for those Covers) as well as out of Cover.<br /> Edit: Alternatively, it could be reduced to 0 and lost, but doing so also unravels the demon along with the Cover.<br /> More inspired by Entitlements than Bloodlines or Lodges, as Entitlements are unique and tends to (though do not have to) be limited to a single person.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/410713/Bloodlines-The-Ageless\" target=\"_blank\">Bloodlines: The Ageless</a> and <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/491569/Fire--Revolution-Carthians\" target=\"_blank\">Fire &amp; Revolution: Carthians</a> on STV<br /> Some other stuff I've done: Ordo Dracul Mysteries: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1138490-idea-coil-of-owls?p=1140522\" target=\"_blank\">Mystery of Smoke</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1227848-mystery-of-%C5%BEiva-house-rule-revision\" target=\"_blank\">Revised Mystery of \u017diva</a> Mage The Awakening: <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B2LMDRtfCcpdZDU1dWJzT1dNeEE/view\" target=\"_blank\">Spell Quick Reference</a> (single page and landscape for computer screens)","edited":{"userid":11887,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11887-tessie","user":"Tessie","date":". 09-05-2021, 04:26 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11887-tessie","name":"Tessie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11887_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-05T23:24:50-07:00","id":1458957,"title":"","content":"If it's to be anything, I'd have to say it's expanding Subverted Infrastructure \u2014 that's already Demon's equivalent of other gamelines' &quot;magical institutions can bend the rules&quot; beyond the scale of an Agenda. Miss Blackfoot having an angel-free sphere of influence as long as she legitimately wins the mayoral election and other Hell-adjacent major undertakings would fit the bill sufficiently as far as specialized personal benefits and affiliations go.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-06T05:06:27-07:00","id":1458990,"title":"","content":"I mean, they already have their Cipher don't they ?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12946-emerick","name":"Emerick","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12946_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"156"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-06T09:03:49-07:00","id":1459017,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Emerick</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/1458865-if-you-had-to-make-a-z-axis-for-demons-what-would-it-be?p=1458990#post1458990\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I mean, they already have their Cipher don't they ?</div> </div> </div> </div>Cipher is completely unique to individuals. It comes with the X splat as Demons. It does not make a Z splat even completed","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-07T16:07:12-07:00","id":1459207,"title":"","content":"As is, Agencies are a little underdeveloped. You could probably brew up some mechanics to attach to one as it accumulates members, hangers-on, and suborned Infrastructure until it becomes something Lodge-like in aspect. Demons already have a lot of personal things going on, between their Agenda, Incarnation, and Cipher, so having a z-axis that acts as a more traditional social structure could provide an interesting contrast.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1423-espritdecalmar","name":"espritdecalmar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1423_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"941"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-13T14:44:17-07:00","id":1459894,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>espritdecalmar</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/1458865-if-you-had-to-make-a-z-axis-for-demons-what-would-it-be?p=1459207#post1459207\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">As is, Agencies are a little underdeveloped. You could probably brew up some mechanics to attach to one as it accumulates members, hangers-on, and suborned Infrastructure until it becomes something Lodge-like in aspect. Demons already have a lot of personal things going on, between their Agenda, Incarnation, and Cipher, so having a z-axis that acts as a more traditional social structure could provide an interesting contrast.</div> </div> </div> </div>Kinda like how Signs and sorcery expanded the way that status in a mage organization works for acquiring services or goods I could see applied to agencies to give them depth.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2909-mr-f-i-x","name":"Mr.F.I.X.","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2909_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1053"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-21T16:58:36-07:00","id":1460762,"title":"","content":"Maybe something called &quot;Protocol&quot; or &quot;Algorithm&quot;, where the demon &quot;installs&quot; a dubious &quot;program&quot; shared by a wider circle of demons which has some Cover elements implemented into it? Like all demons with the same Protocol/Algorithm have a shared Cover feature, and are related to a certain fictional organization/group/structure/theme/whatever that when integrating that piece of Cover the world treats it as true? Like some sort of a viral Cover which demons can share and the God Machine has difficulty at reading, yet also implement some aspects which shape the demon's personality to a degree. Think Agent Smith from Matrix, only less of being completely replaced by the Protocol/Algorithm and more having some of those aspects &quot;infecting&quot; their Covers intentionally. Some demons may even theorize that those are the remains of strong demons who shattered themselves as a part of a failed attempt at completing their Cipher, or who tried to become a God Machine like entity and failed or something across those lines.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-22T00:22:23-07:00","id":1460800,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LostLight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/1458865-if-you-had-to-make-a-z-axis-for-demons-what-would-it-be?p=1460762#post1460762\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Maybe something called &quot;Protocol&quot; or &quot;Algorithm&quot;, where the demon &quot;installs&quot; a dubious &quot;program&quot; shared by a wider circle of demons which has some Cover elements implemented into it? Like all demons with the same Protocol/Algorithm have a shared Cover feature, and are related to a certain fictional organization/group/structure/theme/whatever that when integrating that piece of Cover the world treats it as true? Like some sort of a viral Cover which demons can share and the God Machine has difficulty at reading, yet also implement some aspects which shape the demon's personality to a degree. Think Agent Smith from Matrix, only less of being completely replaced by the Protocol/Algorithm and more having some of those aspects &quot;infecting&quot; their Covers intentionally. Some demons may even theorize that those are the remains of strong demons who shattered themselves as a part of a failed attempt at completing their Cipher, or who tried to become a God Machine like entity and failed or something across those lines.</div> </div> </div> </div>When I saw this thread I actually started thinking about something similar as a variation of my first idea. A shared Cover-thingy that is built up by several demons. Something like a mix between a Bloodline from Vampire and a Legacy from Mage; the nebulous origins of the former with the deliberate advancement in the latter.<br /> <br /> <br /> The Cipher has already been mentioned above. One way to do a z-splat would be to just rework the Cipher completely and expand upon it. In my opinion, the Cipher is badly designed and could really use a redesign anyway.<br /> It wouldn't be a &quot;traditional&quot; z-splat, but developing an expanded Cipher would be a lot like creating a novel Legacy in Mage.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/410713/Bloodlines-The-Ageless\" target=\"_blank\">Bloodlines: The Ageless</a> and <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/491569/Fire--Revolution-Carthians\" target=\"_blank\">Fire &amp; Revolution: Carthians</a> on STV<br /> Some other stuff I've done: Ordo Dracul Mysteries: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1138490-idea-coil-of-owls?p=1140522\" target=\"_blank\">Mystery of Smoke</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1227848-mystery-of-%C5%BEiva-house-rule-revision\" target=\"_blank\">Revised Mystery of \u017diva</a> Mage The Awakening: <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B2LMDRtfCcpdZDU1dWJzT1dNeEE/view\" target=\"_blank\">Spell Quick Reference</a> (single page and landscape for computer screens)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11887-tessie","name":"Tessie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11887_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-27T17:00:07-07:00","id":1461776,"title":"","content":"I like the idea of the Cipher, but I don\u2019t like how it\u2019s essentially a collection of powers that you don\u2019t really have creative control over and you get punished with aggravated damage if you get the embeds wrong","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1686,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1686-korogra","user":"Korogra","date":". 09-27-2021, 08:04 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1686-korogra","name":"Korogra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1686_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1310"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-02T12:56:12-07:00","id":1462466,"title":"","content":"I like the ideas of Subverted Infrastructure and &quot;shared Covers&quot; thingy.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26440-moonwhisper","name":"moonwhisper","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26440_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"99"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-03T01:18:31-07:00","id":1462528,"title":"","content":"Subverted Infrastructure sounds very interesting for a Z-splat. It could allow you to make changes that would benefit you and your allies as an example.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27083-truemrmultiverse","name":"TrueMrMultiverse","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27083_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"85"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}